### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@authToken = your_jwt_token_here

### 1. Get Echo Data (Test Request)
GET https://postman-echo.com/get
Content-Type: application/json

###

### 2. Get All Industrial Items
GET {{baseUrl}}/items
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

###

### 3. Create a New Item
POST {{baseUrl}}/items
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
    "name": "Steel Valve XL",
    "category": "Hardware",
    "quantity": 120,
    "status": "In Stock"
}